{
  "slug": "hipocampus",
  "name": "Hipocampus",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent memory that survives across sessions. Hipocampus gives your agent a 3-tier memory system (hot/warm/cold) with a self-compressing 5-level compaction tree. Every session, the agent auto-loads a ~3K token topic index (ROOT.md) so it knows what it knows — then retrieves specific details on demand via tree traversal or hybrid search (BM25 + vector via qmd). All memory writes happen through subagents to keep your main session clean. Zero dependencies, zero infrastructure — just markdown files.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `compaction` (Build 5-level compaction tree (daily/weekly/monthly/root) with smart thresholds and fixed/tentative lifecycle), `core` (3-tier agent memory system with 5-level compaction tree), `flush` (Manual memory flush: dump current session context to daily raw log via subagent), `recall` (Memory recall guide), `search` (Search memory using qmd (BM25 + optional vector) and compaction tree traversal)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PreCompact`, `TaskCompleted`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hipocampus@claude-community` from `kevin-hs-sohn/hipocampus`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 3
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
